DOM or window)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps astronomy and state testable in Node and usable from the worker; only core/prefs.js touches localStorage (guarded), and astronomy-engine is imported only through js/astro/ae.js by relative path."}, {"id": "claude_three_js_boundary_rule", "label": "three.js boundary (render, camera, main.js and app only; main.js static imports three-free)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "js/ui never imports three or js/render, and the UI and render stack are import()ed, so text mode works without WebGL2 or import maps."}, {"id": "claude_relative_urls_rule", "label": "Relative URLs only (no external URLs outside geocode.js and the About credits)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_no_per_frame_allocation_rule", "label": "No per-frame allocation of geometries, materials, textures or typed arrays", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_shader_output_rule", "label": "Shader rule: every ShaderMaterial fragment ends with tonemapping_fragment and colorspace_fragment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_vector_matrix_convention", "label": "Vector/matrix convention (Float64Array(3), row-major Float64Array(9); column-major Float64Array(16) for three.js)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_clean_console_rule", "label": "Clean console rule (a healthy boot logs one console.info)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L85", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_user_visible_strings_rule", "label": "User-visible strings rule (t()/tn()/N_() whole phrases, Vietnamese in data/i18n/vi.json)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Whole phrases with {placeholders}, never fragments, keep translations grammatical; test/repo.i18n.test.mjs fails on missing, stale or placeholder-mismatched keys; machine formats (URL hash, .ics, diagnostics) stay unlocalized; the astro worker uses the table the client posts to it."}, {"id": "claude_scene_frame", "label": "Scene frame (+Y = J2000 north, 1 unit = Earth radius, S: (x,y,z)->(x,z,-y), earthMatrix = S(PN Rz(GAST))S^T)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L97", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_snapshots", "label": "Snapshots: computeSnapshot 'frame' detail for rendering, 'full' detail at 4 Hz as bus 'readout'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L102", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_frame_loop", "label": "Render-on-demand frame loop (dirty or animating, three-strike module guard, governor sampling)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "L107", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_render_module_contract", "label": "Render module contract {object3d, apply, update, setLayers, setViewMode, setSelection, setQuality, dispose}", "file_type": "concept", "s